{"metadata":{"name":"Sahih al Bukhari","section":{"80":{"eng-name":"Invocations","ara-name":"كتاب الدعوات"}},"section_detail":{"80":{"hadithnumber_first":6304,"hadithnumber_last":6411,"arabicnumber_first":6304,"arabicnumber_last":6411}}},"hadiths":[{"hadithnumber":6334,"arabicnumber":6334,"text":"Rapporté par Anas : Umm Sulaym a dit au Prophète (ﷺ) : « Anas est ton serviteur. » Le Prophète (ﷺ) a dit : « Ô Allah ! Augmente sa richesse et sa descendance, et bénis tout ce que Tu lui donnes. »","grades":[{"name":"Imam Bukhari","grade":"Sahih"}],"reference":{"book":80,"hadith":31},"chapter":{"id":19,"ara-name":"باب قَوْلِ اللَّهِ تَعَالَى {وَصَلِّ عَلَيْهِمْ}","eng-name":"\"... And invoke Allah for them ...\"","isFirstHadith":false}}]}